                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Adee to Mr.
                            Eddy.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1904-10-24"><hi rendition="#italic">October 24,
                        1904</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>(Mr. Adee instructs Mr. Eddy to advise and assist American claimants concerning
                    claims arising from the seizure and confiscation of goods by Russian
                    authorities.)</p>
            </div>
